'''Traveler's Gun''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2023 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2023|2023 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through [[trading]] as the event has since ended. 

==Appearance==
It takes the design of an ancient revolver but with a Halloween theme to it. Its barrel is yellow, but fades into dark brown with tree roots and vines wrapping around it. A Jack-o-lantern takes the place of the cylinder and hammer, and the handle is constructed out of wood with vines wrapped around it.  

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart under the name [[Chroma Traveler's Gun]], which is obtainable from the same box.
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].
*It partners with the [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] knife [[Traveler's Axe]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Traveler Set|Traveler Set]].
*This gun has a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] counterpart named [[Traveler (Gun)|Traveler]].

